<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP-BILLS HOLD FLAT AT 22 PCT AT TENDER.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP-BILLS HOLD FLAT AT 22 PCT AT TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold all 400 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills and 400 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills on offer after banks bid for a combined 897 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield of both of the NBP-bills remained flat at 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
